OL,3,ANetherlands moves billions in gold to
OL,4,ALondon in 'crisis preparedness' move
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Dutch central bank (DNB) has
OL,7,Fconfirmed that billions of dollars in
OL,8,Fgold has been taken out of north
OL,9,FAmerica and relocated to London, citing
OL,10,F"increasing geopolitical unrest".
OL,12,FDNB said on Wednesday that 86 tonnes of
OL,13,Fgold had been removed from the US and
OL,14,FCanada in a complex operation that took
OL,15,Fseveral months. It is now being held by
OL,16,Fthe Bank of England, where the precious
OL,17,Fmetal can be traded more easily "in a
OL,18,Fcrisis situation".
OL,20,FBank president Olaf Sleijpen said the
OL,21,Fmove was "necessary to strengthen our
OL,22,Fresilience and preparedness".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
